  m_text: "Einstein: (examines the script, stroking his chin) \u201CAh\u2026 fascinating.
    This is an early form of hieroglyphics. Let\u2019s see\u2026 It speaks of energy,
    motion, and\u2026 magnetism? Intriguing. It describes a mineral with extraordinary
    magnetic properties\u2014hidden in distant lands, used by those who \u2018sail
    without stars.\u2019 "
